{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"recommendation shilling attack recommendation shilling attack","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","fileName":"Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Recommendation Shilling Attack","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-10-04 14:56\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Recommender System Evolution]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recommender System Evolution","recommendationengines.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"recommendation shilling attack recommendation shilling attack","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","fileName":"Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Recommendation Shilling Attack","heading":"Recommendation Shilling Attack","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A recommendation shilling attack injects strategic ratings, reviews, profiles, or interactions to make a target item appear more or less desirable. Because collaborative systems learn from aggregated behavior, fabricated evidence can distort the neighborhoods and correlations used to rank future recommendations.\n\nThe attack is economically tempting precisely when recommendations influence valuable decisions. Defensive design must distinguish organic preference from coordinated promotion, monitor abnormal interaction patterns, and disclose paid placement rather than letting it masquerade as independent relevance. A system that quietly optimizes for the manipulator sacrifices the trust on which its future recommendations depend.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recommender System Evolution","recommendationengines.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"recommendation shilling attack recommendation shilling attack","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","fileName":"Recommendation Shilling Attack.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Recommendation Shilling Attack","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[recommendationengines.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recommender System Evolution","recommendationengines.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}